=========================================================
  IPC Performance Benchmark: Single-Copy vs. Zero-Copy   
  Iterations: 10000000 messages (52 bytes each) 
=========================================================

[1] Single-Copy (memcpy):
    Time taken:   0.0845 seconds
    Throughput:   118.37 Million msg/sec
    Latency:      8.4 ns per round-trip

[2] Zero-Copy (In-Place reserve/commit):
    Time taken:   0.0533 seconds
    Throughput:   187.45 Million msg/sec
    Latency:      5.3 ns per round-trip

=========================================================
